ific prototype timings. Both meet the same certified tolerance; no true-error ranking, novelty, full-theorem validation, or industrial superiority claim.","mr":"वेळा या संगणकावरील prototypeच्या आहेत. दोन्ही गणना एकच प्रमाणित लक्ष्य पूर्ण करतात. यावरून प्रत्यक्ष त्रुटीचा क्रम, नवीन शोध, पूर्ण theoremची वैधता किंवा औद्योगिक श्रेष्ठता ठरत नाही."}},"conclusion":{"en":"At the common certified tolerance 0.005, the paper’s w₂ reference (Δt=1/256) completed setup, generation and certification in 0.773 s median, versus 1.096 s for RK4 (Δt=1/128): about 29.5% less measured time. At an identical step size, RK4 produced the tighter bound. This is a useful prototype trade-off for this one short-time test, not evidence of general superiority.","mr":"एकच प्रमाणित त्रुटी-लक्ष्य ०.००५ घेतल्यावर, पेपरमधील w₂ (Δt=1/256) साठी तयारी, गणना व प्रमाणपत्र मिळून मध्यम वेळ 0.773 सेकंद आला; RK4 (Δt=1/128) साठी 1.096 सेकंद. या चाचणीत सुमारे 29.5% कमी वेळ लागला. समान वेळेच्या पावलावर RK4ची सीमा अधिक घट्ट होती. हा या एका मर्यादित प्रयोगातील उपयोगी पर्याय आहे; सर्वसाधारण श्रेष्ठतेचा निष्कर्ष नाही."},"timingNote":{"en":"Measured on the same shared Python server, not your browser. Nine generation trials, three certificate trials, seven setup trials; five directly measured cold end-to-end trials at target 0.005. All individual samples are downloadable. End-to-end excludes Python import/startup time.","mr":"वेळा त्याच सामायिक Python serverवर मोजल्या आहेत; तुमच्या browserवर नाहीत. गणनेच्या ९, प्रमाणपत्राच्या ३, तयारीच्या ७ आणि समान ०.००५ लक्ष्यावरील एकूण वेळेच्या ५ चाचण्या केल्या. सर्व कच्चे आकडे डाउनलोडमध्ये आहेत. Python सुरू होण्याचा व importचा वेळ धरलेला नाही."},"scope":{"en":"All bounds belong to exact rational projected piecewise-linear reconstructions, checked against the full PDE residual. They are normalized spatial L² bounds, not pointwise errors, actual measured errors, percentages, or the preprint’s global X-norm convergence claim. Independent here means a separately implemented numerical consistency check; it is not external peer review.","mr":"सर्व सीमा अचूक परिमेय, divergence-free, वेळेनुसार तुकड्यांत रेषीय संदर्भ गणनेसाठी आहेत; पूर्ण PDE residual तपासला आहे. त्या normalized spatial L² सीमा आहेत—प्रत्येक बिंदूची त्रुटी, प्रत्यक्ष खरी त्रुटी, टक्केवारी किंवा पेपरचा global X-norm निष्कर्ष नाहीत. स्वतंत्र तपासणी म्हणजे वेगळ्या codeने केलेली numerical पडताळणी; बाह्य peer review नव्हे."},"validation":{"implementation":{"status":"PASS_IMPLEMENTATION_CHECKS_NOT_PROOF_OF_PAPER","exact_spatial_checks":["F=B(W,W)","B(W,F)+B(F,W)=-W/2+C","all_bases_divergence_free","all_bases_conjugate_real"],"stored_modes":122,"active_w2_modes":54,"max_active_k_squared":6,"max_divergence_coefficient":0.0,"max_reality_defect":0.0,"max_A0_formula_absolute_error":8.881784197001252e-16,"max_heat_profile_relative_error_vs_90digit_decimal":3.4464691552599426e-15,"max_trig_evaluation_error":1.1188630228279524e-16,"invalid_input_rejections":5,"test_times":[0.0,1e-12,1e-08,0.001,0.01,0.0625,0.125,0.25,0.25001,0.5,1.0,4.0,20.0]},"independent":{"method":"Independent literal complex Fourier convolution and Gauss-Legendre evaluation of SW-Q(w1,w1); no solver/certificate implementation used for these references.","scope":"Numerical consistency validation; not a rigorous interval enclosure or independent proof of the manuscript theorem.","field_checks":{"B_WW_minus_literal_F_max":0.0,"B_WF_plus_B_FW_minus_literal_G_max":0.0,"W_modes":6,"F_modes":12,"C_modes":12,"H_modes":24},"times":[{"time":0.0,"explicit_vs_duhamel64_max_coefficient":0.0,"quadrature32_vs64_max_coefficient":0.0,"residual_formula_vs_direct_max_coefficient":0,"w2_active_modes":6,"w2_max_mode_squared":1,"residual_active_modes_above_1e_minus14":0,"residual_max_mode_squared_above_1e_minus14":0,"max_divergence_coefficient":0.0,"max_reality_defect":0.0,"normalized_l2":1.224744871391589},{"time":0.0625,"explicit_vs_duhamel64_max_coefficient":7.589415207398531e-19,"quadrature32_vs64_max_coefficient":1.734723475976807e-18,"residual_f